<!-- Example of Digital NOTAM for stands closures as a result of an apron closure.
     The closure is limited to a "weekdays" schedule during the validity period of the event:
  
     Airport/Heliport: EADE DONLON/INTL.
       Aircraft Stand: EADE DONLON/INTL. | APRON B | H1
                       EADE DONLON/INTL. | APRON B | H2
           Start Time: 2028-02-16 06:00
             End Time: 2028-02-26 12:00
             Schedule: Wed-Fri 0600-1100 Sat 0800-1200 exc Feb 25
       Closure Reason: Apron B closure
                 Note: See NOTAM Axxxx/28
-->

